# process unit:   host-gen:retain; this launch's unit order: core-ffi:retain, incumbent-prod:default, core-ffi:drop, host-gen:retain, core-ffi-pull:drop, host-gen:drop, incumbent-best:default (a seeded shuffle, seed 7919; within this process the cases run in a seeded shuffle too, seed 104729, the 2 prime cases first; requirement 22 as amended, R-H23)
